.TH man 1 "2026-11-19" "0.20.0" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH NAME
/history

.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure message history. Controls displaying past messages from the local database when opening chat windows, and syncing messages from the server using Message Archive Management (MAM, XEP-0313). Use the PG UP key in a window to load older messages.

.SH SYNOPSIS
/history

.LP
/history local on|off

.LP
/history mam on|off

.LP
/history mam verify

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBlocal on|off\fR
.RS 4
Enable or disable showing local database history when opening a window.
.RE
.PP
\fBmam on|off\fR
.RS 4
Enable or disable syncing server message archives (XEP-0313).
.RE
.PP
\fBmam verify\fR
.RS 4
Verify history between oldest and newest messages in current window and fetch missing ones.
.RE

.SH EXAMPLES
/history

.LP
/history local on

.LP
/history mam on

.LP
/history mam verify

.LP
